<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPAIN BEAT YUGOSLAVIA IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPAIN BEAT YUGOSLAVIA IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>CASTELLON, Spain 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain beat Yugoslavia 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in their European under-21 soccer championship group six qualifying match on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Fernando Morientes 73</p>
<p>Attendance: 12,000.</p>
